      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jackson%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "On the west side of the Wildcat River once stood a clothespin factory, saw mill, post office, church, school, and blacksmith shop, showing Jackson’s early industrial mix.",
